gh-162282: Fix quadratic cost in urllib.robotparser._add_entry (GH-162283)

* gh-162282: Fix quadratic cost in urllib.robotparser._add_entry

Parsing a robots.txt with many identical User-agent: lines in a single
group ran in O(N^2) time: _add_entry iterated entry.useragents without
deduplication, and from the second duplicate on merge_entries was
called once per iteration; merge_entries is itself O(N).

Track the agents already registered during the current call and skip
duplicates. For every input shape other than 'same agent repeated
within one entry' the behavior is identical. On 10,000 duplicate
User-agent lines the parse time drops from ~2.5 s to ~0.003 s.

A regression test parses 50,000 duplicate User-agent lines and
requires completion in under 5 seconds.

* Update Lib/test/test_robotparser.py

